# Nginx Reverse Proxy for NHQ Connect

> Draft — SSL renewal section still to be written.

## Server block

```nginx
server {
  listen 443 ssl;
  server_name nhq.example.com;

  ssl_certificate     /etc/ssl/nhq.crt;
  ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/nhq.key;

  location / {
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;
  }
}
```

